<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="az">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Jalə Əliyeva — UX/UI Designer</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300..900;1,9..144,300..900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --cream: #FFF8EF;
    --cream-dim: #F3EADA;
    --ink: #1A1530;
    --ink-soft: #2D2640;
    --coral: #FF5630;
    --coral-deep: #D9431F;
    --gold: #FFC23F;
    --paper: #FFFDFA;
    --line: rgba(26,21,48,0.14);
    --line-strong: rgba(26,21,48,0.28);
  }

  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}

  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}

  body{
    background:var(--cream);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    overflow-x:hidden;
    cursor:none;
  }

  ::selection{background:var(--coral); color:var(--cream);}

  /* ---------- Custom cursor (signature element) ---------- */
  #cursor-dot{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; width:8px; height:8px;
    background:var(--coral); border-radius:50%;
    pointer-events:none; z-index:9999;
    transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    transition:transform .12s ease-out, background .2s;
  }
  #cursor-ring{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; width:34px; height:34px;
    border:1.5px solid var(--ink); border-radius:50%;
    pointer-events:none; z-index:9998;
    transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    transition:transform .18s ease-out, width .2s, height .2s, border-color .2s, opacity .2s;
  }
  #cursor-label{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; pointer-events:none; z-index:9999;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; font-weight:600;
    color:var(--ink); background:var(--gold); padding:2px 7px; border-radius:3px;
    transform:translate(14px,14px); opacity:0; transition:opacity .15s;
    white-space:nowrap; letter-spacing:.02em;
  }
  @media (hover:none){
    #cursor-dot,#cursor-ring,#cursor-label{display:none;}
    body{cursor:auto;}
    a,button{cursor:pointer;}
  }

  /* ---------- Coordinate / canvas chrome ---------- */
  .coord{
    position:absolute;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
    font-size:10.5px;
    color:var(--ink);
    opacity:.38;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .corner-tick{
    position:absolute; width:14px; height:14px;
    pointer-events:none; opacity:.55;
  }
  .corner-tick.tl{top:0;left:0;border-top:1.5px solid var(--ink);border-left:1.5px solid var(--ink);}
  .corner-tick.tr{top:0;right:0;border-top:1.5px solid var(--ink);border-right:1.5px solid var(--ink);}
  .corner-tick.bl{bottom:0;left:0;border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--ink);border-left:1.5px solid var(--ink);}
  .corner-tick.br{bottom:0;right:0;border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--ink);border-right:1.5px solid var(--ink);}

  .frame{position:relative;}

  /* ---------- Top toolbar (fixed) ---------- */
  #toolbar{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:500;
    height:56px;
    background:rgba(255,248,239,0.86);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:0 28px;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
    font-size:12px;
  }
  #toolbar .tb-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
  #toolbar .tb-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--coral);}
  #toolbar .tb-name{font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.01em;}
  #toolbar nav{display:flex;gap:26px;}
  #toolbar nav a{
    color:var(--ink); text-decoration:none; opacity:.62;
    font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.02em;
    transition:opacity .2s;
    position:relative;
  }
  #toolbar nav a:hover{opacity:1;}
  #toolbar .tb-zoom{opacity:.5; font-size:11px;}

  @media (max-width:880px){
    #toolbar nav{display:none;}
    .coord{display:none;}
  }

  main{padding-top:56px;}

  /* ---------- Layer badge ---------- */
  .layer-badge{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; font-weight:500;
    color:var(--coral-deep);
    background:rgba(255,86,48,0.1);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,86,48,0.3);
    padding:5px 12px; border-radius:20px;
    letter-spacing:.03em;
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .layer-badge::before{content:'';width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--coral);}

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  #hero{
    position:relative;
    min-height:calc(100vh - 56px);
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center;
    padding:0 7vw;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .hero-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr; gap:60px; align-items:center;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:12.5px; letter-spacing:.08em;
    color:var(--coral-deep); text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:18px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow .hr{width:34px;height:1px;background:var(--coral-deep);display:inline-block;}
  h1.hero-title{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 5.4rem);
    line-height:0.98;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  h1.hero-title em{
    font-style:italic; font-weight:400; color:var(--coral);
    position:relative;
  }
  .hero-sub{
    margin-top:26px; max-width:480px;
    font-size:1.08rem; line-height:1.65; color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .hero-sub b{color:var(--ink); font-weight:700;}
  .hero-ctas{margin-top:36px; display:flex; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn{
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:14.5px;
    padding:14px 26px; border-radius:8px; border:none;
    cursor:none; text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.3), box-shadow .25s;
  }
  .btn-primary{
    background:var(--ink); color:var(--cream);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-3px); box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(26,21,48,0.25);}
  .btn-ghost{
    background:transparent; color:var(--ink); border:1.5px solid var(--line-strong);
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover{transform:translateY(-3px); border-color:var(--ink);}

  .hero-visual{
    position:relative;
    height:560px;
    border-radius:18px;
    overflow:hidden;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--ink);
  }
  .hero-visual img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 18%;display:block;}
  .hero-visual .frame-tag{
    position:absolute; top:14px; left:14px;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:10.5px;
    background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); padding:4px 10px; border-radius:5px;
    border:1px solid var(--line); z-index:3;
  }
  .hero-stats{
    position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0; right:0;
    background:rgba(26,21,48,0.92);
    backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    padding:16px 18px;
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between;
    border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  }
  .hero-stats .stat{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;}
  .hero-stats .stat b{display:block; color:var(--gold); font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:600;}
  .hero-stats .stat span{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65); font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.02em;}

  .hero-marquee-wrap{
    position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0; right:0;
    overflow:hidden; border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--cream-dim);
    padding:13px 0;
  }
  .hero-marquee{
    display:flex; gap:48px; white-space:nowrap;
    animation:marquee 26s linear infinite;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.05em;
    color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:.7;
  }
  @keyframes marquee{from{transform:translateX(0);} to{transform:translateX(-50%);}}

  @media (max-width:880px){
    .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:40px;}
    .hero-visual{max-width:420px; margin:0 auto; height:420px;}
  }

  /* ---------- Section shell ---------- */
  section{
    position:relative;
    padding:120px 7vw;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .section-head{margin-bottom:64px; max-width:680px;}
  .section-index{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; color:var(--coral-deep);
    letter-spacing:.06em; margin-bottom:14px; display:block;
  }
  h2.section-title{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:500;
    font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem); line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  .section-desc{margin-top:18px; font-size:1.05rem; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.6; max-width:560px;}

  /* ---------- About ---------- */
  #about .about-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.15fr; gap:70px; align-items:start;
  }
  .about-photo-wrap{position:relative;}
  .about-photo{
    position:relative; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden;
    background:linear-gradient(160deg, var(--gold) 0%, var(--coral) 100%);
    padding:0;
  }
  .about-photo img{width:100%; display:block;}
  .about-photo-tag{
    position:absolute; top:-12px; right:-12px;
    background:var(--ink); color:var(--cream);
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px;
    padding:8px 14px; border-radius:30px; transform:rotate(4deg);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
  }
  .about-text p{font-size:1.12rem; line-height:1.75; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:22px;}
  .about-text p b{color:var(--ink); font-weight:700;}
  .about-tools{margin-top:38px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px;}
  .tool-chip{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:12px;
    border:1px solid var(--line-strong); padding:7px 14px; border-radius:6px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width:880px){
    #about .about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:42px;}
  }

  /* ---------- Process ---------- */
  #process{background:var(--ink); color:var(--cream); border-bottom:none;}
  #process .section-desc{color:rgba(255,248,239,0.65);}
  #process .section-index{color:var(--gold);}
  .process-rail{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:0;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,248,239,0.16); border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .process-step{
    padding:38px 32px; border-right:1px solid rgba(255,248,239,0.16);
    position:relative;
  }
  .process-step:last-child{border-right:none;}
  .process-tag{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; color:var(--coral);
    letter-spacing:.06em; margin-bottom:18px; display:block;
  }
  .process-step h3{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:500; margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .process-step p{font-size:.97rem; line-height:1.65; color:rgba(255,248,239,0.62);}
  .process-arrow{
    position:absolute; top:38px; right:-13px; z-index:2;
    width:26px; height:26px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--ink);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,248,239,0.3);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    color:var(--gold); font-size:13px;
  }
  .process-step:last-child .process-arrow{display:none;}

  @media (max-width:880px){
    .process-rail{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .process-step{border-right:none; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,248,239,0.16);}
    .process-arrow{display:none;}
  }

  /* ---------- Projects ---------- */
  #work{padding-bottom:60px;}
  .project{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:0.95fr 1.05fr; gap:64px;
    align-items:center;
    padding:64px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .project:first-of-type{border-top:none;}
  .project:nth-of-type(even) .project-media{order:2;}
  .project:nth-of-type(even) .project-copy{order:1;}

  .project-media{position:relative;}
  .project-media-inner{
    border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--ink); position:relative;
    max-height:560px;
  }
  .project-media-inner img{width:100%; height:560px; object-fit:contain; object-position:center; display:block;}
  .project-frame-tag{
    position:absolute; top:12px; left:12px; z-index:3;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:10px;
    background:var(--paper); padding:4px 9px; border-radius:5px; border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .project-num{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-style:italic; font-size:5.5rem;
    position:absolute; top:-46px; left:-6px; color:var(--line-strong);
    z-index:0; line-height:1; pointer-events:none;
    font-weight:400;
  }
  .project-copy{position:relative; z-index:1;}
  .project-kicker{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--coral-deep);
    letter-spacing:.05em; margin-bottom:12px; text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .project-title{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:500; font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.5rem);
    margin-bottom:16px; line-height:1.08;
  }
  .project-desc{font-size:1.02rem; line-height:1.68; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:22px;}
  .project-stats{display:flex; gap:28px; margin-bottom:26px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .project-stats .pstat b{
    display:block; font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:1.5rem; color:var(--coral-deep);
  }
  .project-stats .pstat span{font-size:11px; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:.75;}
  .project-tags{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px;}
  .ptag{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px;
    border:1px solid var(--line-strong); padding:5px 11px; border-radius:5px; color:var(--ink-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width:880px){
    .project, .project:nth-of-type(even){grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .project:nth-of-type(even) .project-media{order:1;}
    .project:nth-of-type(even) .project-copy{order:2;}
    .project-num{display:none;}
    .project-media-inner{max-height:380px;}
    .project-media-inner img{height:380px; object-fit:contain;}
  }

  /* ---------- Contact ---------- */
  #contact{
    background:var(--ink); color:var(--cream); border-bottom:none;
    text-align:left;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  #contact .section-index{color:var(--gold);}
  h2.contact-title{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:500;
    font-size:clamp(2.6rem,7vw,6rem); line-height:0.98; letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    margin-bottom:40px;
  }
  h2.contact-title em{font-style:italic; color:var(--coral); font-weight:400;}
  .contact-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr; gap:50px; align-items:end;
    margin-top:50px;
  }
  .contact-links{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0;}
  .contact-row{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    padding:20px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,248,239,0.16);
    text-decoration:none; color:var(--cream);
    transition:padding-left .25s;
  }
  .contact-row:hover{padding-left:10px;}
  .contact-row:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,248,239,0.16);}
  .contact-row .label{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; color:rgba(255,248,239,0.5); letter-spacing:.05em;}
  .contact-row .value{font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:1.5rem;}
  .contact-row .arrow{opacity:.5; transition:transform .25s, opacity .25s;}
  .contact-row:hover .arrow{opacity:1; transform:translateX(4px);}

  .contact-meta{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,248,239,0.45); line-height:1.8;}
  .contact-meta .meta-title{color:var(--gold); display:block; margin-bottom:10px; letter-spacing:.05em;}

  footer{
    padding:26px 7vw; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; color:rgba(255,248,239,0.4);
    border-top:1px solid rgba(255,248,239,0.1);
  }
  @media (max-width:880px){
    .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    footer{flex-direction:column; gap:8px; text-align:center;}
  }

  /* ---------- Reveal animation ---------- */
  .reveal{opacity:0; transform:translateY(28px); transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .reveal{opacity:1; transform:none; transition:none;}
    .hero-marquee{animation:none;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="cursor-dot"></div>
<div id="cursor-ring"></div>
<div id="cursor-label"></div>

<div id="toolbar">
  <div class="tb-left">
    <div class="tb-dot"></div>
    <span class="tb-name">Jalə Əliyeva</span>
  </div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#about">Haqqımda</a>
    <a href="#process">Proses</a>
    <a href="#work">Layihələr</a>
    <a href="#contact">Əlaqə</a>
  </nav>
  <span class="tb-zoom">AZ · UX/UI</span>
</div>

<main>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section id="hero" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom:0;">
    <div class="corner-tick tl"></div>
    <div class="corner-tick tr"></div>
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="reveal in">
        <div class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="hr"></span>UX / UI Designer · Bakı</div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">İstifadəçi<br>ehtiyacını <em>formaya</em><br>çevirirəm.</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Salam, mən <b>Jalə Əliyeva</b>. Araşdırmadan interfeysə qədər bütün prosesi idarə edən UX/UI dizaynerəm — NABZ, Ticket's və Neyrosoft kimi layihələrdə məhsul strategiyasından vizual dizayna qədər işləmişəm.</p>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href="#work" class="btn btn-primary" data-cursor="Bax →">Layihələrə bax</a>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-ghost" data-cursor="Yaz →">Əlaqə saxla</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual reveal in" style="transition-delay:.15s;">
        <span class="frame-tag">frame · hero.fig</span>
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Jalə Əliyeva">
        <div class="hero-stats">
          <div class="stat"><b>3</b><span>TAMAMLANMIŞ LAYİHƏ</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>29</b><span>İSTİFADƏÇİ ARAŞDIRMASI</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>04</b><span>ƏSAS INSIGHT</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-marquee-wrap">
      <div class="hero-marquee">
        <span>USER RESEARCH</span><span>·</span><span>INFORMATION ARCHITECTURE</span><span>·</span><span>WIREFRAMING</span><span>·</span><span>UI DESIGN</span><span>·</span><span>PROTOTYPING</span><span>·</span><span>USABILITY TESTING</span>
        <span>USER RESEARCH</span><span>·</span><span>INFORMATION ARCHITECTURE</span><span>·</span><span>WIREFRAMING</span><span>·</span><span>UI DESIGN</span><span>·</span><span>PROTOTYPING</span><span>·</span><span>USABILITY TESTING</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section id="about" class="frame">
    <span class="coord" style="top:18px; left:24px;">x:48 y:120</span>
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="section-index">01 — Haqqımda</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Tədqiqatdan başlayıb,<br>interfeysə gedən yol.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-photo-wrap reveal">
        <div class="about-photo">
          <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Jalə Əliyeva">
        </div>
        <div class="about-photo-tag">Bakı, AZ 🇦🇿</div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-text reveal" style="transition-delay:.1s;">
        <p><b>UX/UI Designer</b> olaraq istifadəçi ehtiyaclarını araşdırır və onları intuitiv rəqəmsal təcrübələrə çevirirəm. İstifadəçi araşdırması, informasiya arxitekturası, istifadəçi axınları və interfeys dizaynı üzərində işləyirəm.</p>
        <p>Son layihələrim arasında <b>Ticket's</b> və <b>NABZ</b> platformaları yer alır. Bu layihələr vasitəsilə məhsul strategiyası qurmaq və müasir UX prinsiplərini tətbiq etmək təcrübəsi qazanmışam.</p>
        <p>Hazırda innovativ və istifadəçi yönümlü rəqəmsal məhsullar yaratmağa fokuslanıram — hər layihəyə həm analitik, həm də estetik baxışla yanaşıram.</p>
        <div class="about-tools">
          <span class="tool-chip">Figma</span>
